OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABritish woman killed in stabbing at
OL,4,AGerman railway station
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers arrested a 27-year-old German
OL,7,Fman at the scene immediately after the
OL,8,Fincident. The background and motive for
OL,9,Fthe attack is under investigation, the
OL,10,Fstatement added.
OL,12,FPolice have asked anyone who may have
OL,13,Fwitnessed "an argument or physical
OL,14,Faltercation" at the station late on
OL,15,FSaturday or early on Sunday to contact
OL,16,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
